steps.description:
Set up the workspace and implement the improvement:
1. Read the proposal document (${proposal_link}) to understand what to change and why
2. Clone or fetch the repo into the mission workspace
3. Create a feature branch: `refactor/IMP-${branch_slug}`
4. Read all files within scope: ${scope_globs}
5. Implement the changes strictly within scope globs — do NOT touch files outside scope
6. Write clear, atomic commits with 'why' not just 'what'

Scope constraint: ${scope_globs}
Acceptance criteria: ${acceptance_criteria}

Output: list of files changed with a summary of each change.
